nt eligible\n  (b) Safety-critical battery defect → mandatory replacement per safety policy\n  (c) 14-day replacement window → time-sensitive action required\n\nRECOMMENDED NEXT STEPS FOR OPERATIONS_MANAGER:\n- Initiate a hardware replacement order for Asset AST-8821 under active warranty coverage\n- Assign replacement device to USR-ETHAN-BROOKS, Cost Center CC-2077\n- Decommission/quarantine AST-8821 (battery swelling — do not continue use)\n- Target completion before 2026-05-08\n\nPolicy analysis complete.","timestamp":"2026-04-25T00:35:30.184000+00:00"}
